p\",\"position\":2,\"name\":\"Buy Glowing Wand\",\"text\":\"Purchase Glowing Wand (2,050 gold) as item 2 in the Anti-Dive Survival build for Vexana.\",\"url\":\"https://mlbbhub.com/heroes/vexana#build-mid-anti-dive-survival\"},{\"@type\":\"HowToStep\",\"position\":3,\"name\":\"Buy Winter Crown\",\"text\":\"Purchase Winter Crown (1,910 gold) as item 3 in the Anti-Dive Survival build for Vexana.\",\"url\":\"https://mlbbhub.com/heroes/vexana#build-mid-anti-dive-survival\"},{\"@type\":\"HowToStep\",\"position\":4,\"name\":\"Buy Blood Wings\",\"text\":\"Purchase Blood Wings (2,100 gold) as item 4 in the Anti-Dive Survival build for Vexana.\",\"url\":\"https://mlbbhub.com/heroes/vexana#build-mid-anti-dive-survival\"},{\"@type\":\"HowToStep\",\"position\":5,\"name\":\"Buy Divine Glaive\",\"text\":\"Purchase Divine Glaive (1,970 gold) as item 5 in the Anti-Dive Survival build for Vexana.\",\"url\":\"https://mlbbhub.com/heroes/vexana#build-mid-anti-dive-survival\"},{\"@type\":\"HowToStep\",\"position\":6,\"name\":\"Buy Immortality\",\"text\":\"Purchase Immortality (2,120 gold) as item 6 in the Anti-Dive Survival build for Vexana.\",\"url\":\"https://mlbbhub.com/heroes/vexana#build-mid-anti-dive-survival\"}],\"mainEntityOfPage\":{\"@type\":\"WebPage\",\"@id\":\"https://mlbbhub.com/heroes/vexana\"},\"datePublished\":\"2026-04-20T00:00:00.000Z\",\"dateModified\":\"2026-05-13T00:00:00.000Z\",\"author\":{\"@type\":\"Organization\",\"name\":\"MLBBHub\",\"url\":\"https://mlbbhub.com\"}}60:[\"$\",\"script\",\"2\",{\"type\":\"application/ld+json\",\"dangerouslySetInnerHTML\":{\"__html\":\"$64\"}}]\n61:[\"$\",\"$L65\",null,{\"hero\":{\"id\":38,\"name\":\"Vexana\",\"slug\":\"vexana\",\"title\":\"Shimmer of Hope\",\"role\":[\"Mage\"],\"specialty\":[\"Poke\",\"Control\"],\"lane\":[\"Mid\"],\"tier\":\"B\",\"difficulty\":1,\"releaseYear\":2017,\"stats\":{\"durability\":20,\"offense\":90,\"controlEffect\":50,\"difficulty\":10},\"winRate\":49.56,\"pickRate\":1.48,\"banRate\":1.11,\"counters\":{\"strongAgainst\":[{\"heroSlug\":\"layla\",\"heroName\":\"Layla\",\"advantage\":\"strong\",\"tip\":\"Backline DPS heroes such as Layla, Irithel and Xavier.\"},{\"heroSlug\":\"irithel\",\"heroName\":\"Irithel\",\"advantage\":\"strong\",\"tip\":\"Backline DPS heroes such as Layla, Irithel and Xavier.\"},{\"heroSlug\":\"xavier\",\"heroName\":\"Xavier\",\"advantage\":\"strong\",\"tip\":\"Backline DPS heroes such as Layla, Irithel and Xavier.\"}],\"weakAgainst\":[{\"heroSlug\":\"saber\",\"heroName\":\"Saber\",\"advantage\":\"weak\",\"tip\":\"Mobile Assassins such as Saber, Aamon and Karina.\"},{\"heroSlug\":\"aamon\",\"heroName\":\"Aamon\",\"advantage\":\"weak\",\"tip\":\"Mobile Assassins such as Saber, Aamon and Karina.\"},{\"heroSlug\":\"karina\",\"heroName\":\"Karina\",\"advantage\":\"weak\",\"tip\":\"Mobile Assassins such as Saber, Aamon and Karina.\"}]},\"splashArt\":\"https://akmweb.youngjoygame.com/web/svnres/file/mlbb/homepage/100_f1a01e297d30d147c16342efc357275e.jpg\",\"portrait\":\"https://akmweb.youngjoygame.com/web/svnres/img/test/homepage_2_2_16_1232_1/100_743edd1702084c4ed247908d698bca77.png\",\"officialMatchups\":[{\"kind\":\"best_ally\",\"heroId\":\"6\",\"heroName\":\"Tigreal\",\"heroSlug\":\"tigreal\",\"icon\":\"https://akmwebstatic.yuanzhanapp.com/web/madmin/image_23a7a603ff9d20074777d52e2eb202f3.jpg\",\"tip\":\"He is one of the best clash initiators in the game. He has hard crowd control and take enemies wherever direction he wants.\"},{\"kind\":\"counters\",\"heroId\":\"46\",\"heroName\":\"Odette\",\"heroSlug\":\"odette\",\"icon\":\"https://akmweb.youngjoygame.com/web/madmin/image/071fd5539ac4ba53b1dc27195cd6d4bd.png?w=150-150-fff8da\",\"tip\":\"Odette's ultimate takes time to deal more damage. But with Vexana's Charmed Scepter, her ultimate can be cancelled quickly. In this way, Odette is now useless and will rely on her abilities.\"},{\"kind\":\"countered_by\",\"heroId\":\"47\",\"heroName\":\"Lancelot\",\"heroSlug\":\"lancelot\",\"icon\":\"https://akmweb.youngjoygame.com/web/madmin/image/e20549844522450e535e614538699eb9.png?w=150-150-ffe4db\",\"tip\":\"Lancelot has a very high mobility. With its skills and his ultimate, Lancelot can quickly dash over the enemy or run away from them. In this way, Lancelot counters Vexana because his skills deal alot of damage in just a single skill. Lancelot's Thorned Rose counters Vexana in a way such that he is invulnerable for a very short time, tendency, Vexana's skills will miss and will not do much damage.\"}],\"skills\":{\"skills\":[{\"name\":\"Nether Touch\",\"type\":\"Passive\",\"description\":\"Vexana and her Eternal Guard inflict Nether Touch on enemies hit. The mark lasts 5s and causes the affected enemy to explode upon death, dealing 108-500 (+60% Total Magic Power) Magic Damage to nearby enemies (base damage scales with level).\",\"descriptionRich\":[{\"type\":\"text\",\"text\":\"Vexana and her \"},{\"type\":\"text\",\"text\":\"Eternal Guard\",\"color\":\"#a6aafb\"},{\"type\":\"text\",\"text\":\" inflict \"},{\"type\":\"text\",\"text\":\"Nether Touch\",\"color\":\"#a6aafb\"},{\"type\":\"text\",\"text\":\" on enemies hit. The mark lasts 5s and causes the affected enemy to explode upon death, dealing 108-500\"},{\"type\":\"text\",\"text\":\" (+60% Total Magic Power)\",\"color\":\"#62f8fe\"},{\"type\":\"text\",\"text\":\" Magic Damage to nearby enemies (base damage scales with level).\"}],\"cooldown\":null,\"manaCost\":null,\"icon\":\"https://akmweb.youngjoygame.com/web/svnres/img/test/homepage_2_2_16_1232_1/100_4a772fea90f7fef17b012afc119091a7.png\",\"tags\":[\"Damage\"]},{\"name\":\"Deathly Grasp\",\"type\":\"Skill 1\",\"description\":\"Vexana unleashes a Deathly Grasp in the target direction, dealing 200 (+60% Total Magic Power) Magic Damage to enemies in its path. It stops upon hitting an enemy hero, Terrifying and knocking them back. After a short delay, it explodes, dealing 200 (+60% Total Magic Power) Magic Damage to nearby enemies and Terrifying them for 1s.\",\"descriptionRich\":[{\"type\":\"text\",\"text\":\"Vexana unleashes a \"},{\"type\":\"text\",\"text\":\"Deathly Grasp\",\"color\":\"#a6aafb\"},{\"type\":\"text\",\"text\":\" in the target direction, dealing 200\"},{\"type\":\"text\",\"text\":\" (+60% Total Magic Power)\",\"color\":\"#62f8fe\"},{\"type\":\"text\",\"text\":\" Magic Damage to enemies in its path. It stops upon hitting an enemy hero, \"},{\"type\":\"text\",\"text\":\"Terrifying\",\"color\":\"#a6aafb\"},{\"type\":\"text\",\"text\":\" and knocking them back. After a short delay, it explodes, dealing 200\"},{\"type\":\"text\",\"text\":\" (+60% Total Magic Power)\",\"color\":\"#62f8fe\"},{\"type\":\"text\",\"text\":\" Magic Damage to nearby enemies and \"},{\"type\":\"text\",\"text\":\"Terrifying\",\"color\":\"#a6aafb\"},{\"type\":\"text\",\"text\":\" them for 1s.\"}],\"cooldown\":\"14s\",\"manaCost\":\"80\",\"icon\":\"https://akmweb.youngjoygame.com/web/svnres/img/test/homepage_2_2_16_1232_1/100_306fd329581b6ea4590086598d250df1.png\",\"tags\":[\"CC\",\"AOE\"]},{\"name\":\"Cursed Blast\",\"type\":\"Skill 2\",\"description\":\"Vexana marks the target area with the power of the undead, striking it after a 0.8s delay and dealing 580 (+165% Total Magic Power) Magic Damage to enemies hit.\",\"descriptionRich\":[{\"type\":\"text\",\"text\":\"Vexana marks the target area with the power of the undead, striking it after a 0.8s delay and dealing 580\"},{\"type\":\"text\",\"text\":\" (+165% Total Magic Power)\",\"color\":\"#62f8fe\"},{\"type\":\"text\",\"text\":\" Magic Damage to enemies hit.\"}],\"cooldown\":\"7s\",\"manaCost\":\"60\",\"icon\":\"https://akmweb.youngjoygame.com/web/svnres/img/test/homepage_2_2_16_1232_1/100_f0142fc0def21fe074ec6feb4a24fa07.png\",\"tags\":[\"AOE\"]},{\"name\":\"Eternal Guard\",\"type\":\"Ultimate\",\"description\":\"Vexana summons an Eternal Guard at the target location, dealing 480 (+60% Total Magic Power) Magic Damage to enemies hit and knocking them airborne for 0.8s. The Eternal Guard then joins Vexana in battle for 15s. Its attacks deal 200 (+40% Total Magic Power) (+ 5% target's Max HP) Magic Damage and Splash Damage in a large area.\",\"descriptionRich\":[{\"type\":\"text\",\"text\":\"Vexana summons an \"},{\"type\":\"text\",\"text\":\"Eternal Guard\",\"color\":\"#a6aafb\"},{\"type\":\"text\",\"text\":\" at the target location, dealing 480\"},{\"type\":\"text\",\"text\":\" (+60% Total Magic Power)\",\"color\":\"#62f8fe\"},{\"type\":\"text\",\"text\":\" Magic Damage to enemies hit and knocking them airborne for 0.8s. The \"},{\"type\":\"text\",\"text\":\"Eternal Guard\",\"color\":\"#a6aafb\"},{\"type\":\"text\",\"text\":\" then joins Vexana in battle for 15s. Its attacks deal 200\"},{\"type\":\"text\",\"text\":\" (+40% Total Magic Power)\",\"color\":\"#62f8fe\"},{\"type\":\"text\",\"text\":\" (+ 5% target's Max HP) Magic Damage and Splash Damage in a large area.\"}],\"cooldown\":\"60s\",\"manaCost\":\"120\",\"icon\":\"https://akmweb.youngjoygame.com/web/svnres/img/test/homepage_2_2_16_1232_1/100_1a95d813fc47cb5ec048784dacd7b46e.png\",\"tags\":[\"Summon\",\"Damage\"]}],\"skillUpgradePriority\":\"3-2-1\",\"skillPriorityTip\":\"You have to put priority on your second skill because it is the one that does major damage among all your skills. Max the first skill last because it is only used in engaging a fight or running away from your enemy. Then level up your ultimate whenever possible.\\nVexana need alot of movement speed so that she can place her skill perfectly on a moving enemy hero. Sprint will help Vexana catch up on clash. This will also help her travel lanes in a short period of time. This can be used on chasing enemy heroes or running away from them.\",\"skillPriorityTipRich\":[{\"type\":\"text\",\"text\":\"You have to put priority on your second skill because it is the one that does major damage among all your skills. Max the first skill last because it is only used in engaging a fight or running away from your enemy. Then level up your ultimate whenever possible.\"},{\"type\":\"lineBreak\"},{\"type\":\"text\",\"text\":\"Vexana need alot of movement speed so that she can place her skill perfectly on a moving enemy hero. Sprint will help Vexana catch up on clash. This will also help her travel lanes in a short period of time. This can be used on chasing enemy heroes or running away from them. \"}]},\"synergies\":[{\"heroSlug\":\"atlas\",\"heroName\":\"Atlas\",\"synergyScore\":8,\"reason\":\"Heroes with powerful CC such as Atlas or\\nhigh damage output like Beatrix to burst down enemies.\"},{\"heroSlug\":\"beatrix\",\"heroName\":\"Beatrix\",\"synergyScore\":8,\"reason\":\"Heroes with powerful CC such as Atlas or\\nhigh damage output like Beatrix to burst down enemies.\"}],\"combos\":[{\"type\":\"teamfight\",\"title\":\"TEAMFIGHT COMBOS\",\"description\":\"Initiate teamfights with CC or follow up after other CC. \\r\\nUse her Ultimate when enemies are gathered, follow up \\r\\nwith 2nd and 1st Skill combo for CC and damage.\",\"skillSequence\":[{\"skillId\":3830,\"skillIcon\":\"https://akmweb.youngjoygame.com/web/svnres/img/test/homepage_2_2_16_1232_1/100_1a95d813fc47cb5ec048784dacd7b46e.png\"},{\"skillId\":3820,\"skillIcon\":\"https://akmweb.youngjoygame.com/web/svnres/img/test/homepage_2_2_16_1232_1/100_f0142fc0def21fe074ec6feb4a24fa07.png\"},{\"skillId\":3810,\"skillIcon\":\"https://akmweb.youngjoygame.com/web/svnres/img/test/homepage_2_2_16_1232_1/100_306fd329581b6ea4590086598d250df1.png\"}]},{\"type\":\"laning\",\"title\":\"LANING COMBOS\",\"description\":\"Terrify enemy with 1st Skill and follow up with 2nd Skill for guaranteed damage.\",\"skillSequence\":[{\"skillId\":3810,\"skillIcon\":\"https://akmweb.youngjoygame.com/web/svnres/img/test/homepage_2_2_16_1232_1/100_306fd329581b6ea4590086598d250df1.png\"},{\"skillId\":3820,\"skillIcon\":\"https://akmweb.youngjoygame.com/web/svnres/img/test/homepage_2_2_16_1232_1/100_f0142fc0def21fe074ec6feb4a24fa07.png\"}]}],\"metaDescription\":\"Vexana build and counter guide for Mobile Legends: Glowing Wand plus Wishing Lantern spike, draft windows, positioning rules, and anti-dive flex buys.\",\"builds\":[],\"overviewLede\":\"Vexana is not a blind-pick mid. She is a punish mage that turns crowded fights and obvious movement into free damage. If your draft can start first or the map forces the enemy through narrow entrances, she feels oppressive; if you need her to create space alone, she looks slow and fake.\"},\"serverLocale\":\"en\",\"curatedBuilds\":{\"source\":\"curated\",\"hero\":\"vexana\",\"patch\":\"2.1.67\",\"lastReviewed\":\"2026-05-13\",\"stalePatch\":true,\"currentPatch\":\"2.2.16a\",\"builds\":[{\"slot\":1,\"id\":\"mid-zone-control\",\"name\":\"Mid Zone Control\",\"roleContext\":\"Mid\",\"items\":[{\"slug\":\"arcane-boots\",\"name\":\"Arcane Boots\",\"cost\":690,\"fixed\":false},{\"slug\":\"glowing-wand\",\"name\":\"Glowing Wand\",\"cost\":2050,\"fixed\":false},{\"slug\":\"wishing-lantern\",\"name\":\"Wishing Lantern\",\"cost\":2250,\"fixed\":false},{\"slug\":\"blood-wings\",\"name\":\"Blood Wings\",\"cost\":2100,\"fixed\":false},{\"slug\":\"divine-glaive\",\"name\":\"Divine Glaive\",\"cost\":1970,\"fixed\":false},{\"slug\":\"holy-crystal\",\"name\":\"Holy Crystal\",\"cost\":3000,\"fixed\":false}],\"coreItems\":[{\"slug\":\"glowing-wand\",\"name\":\"Glowing Wand\"},{\"slug\":\"wishing-lantern\",\"name\":\"Wishing Lantern\"},{\"slug\":\"blood-wings\",\"name\":\"Blood Wings\"}],\"emblem\":{\"slug\":\"mage\",\"name\":\"Mage Emblem\",\"talents\":[{\"slug\":\"rupture\",\"name\":\"Rupture\",\"iconUrl\":\"/images/talents/rupture.png\",\"bucket\":\"standard\"},{\"slug\":\"wilderness-blessing\",\"name\":\"Wilderness Blessing\",\"iconUrl\":\"/images/talents/wilderness-blessing.png\",\"bucket\":\"standard\"},{\"slug\":\"lethal-ignition\",\"name\":\"Lethal Ignition\",\"iconUrl\":\"/images/talents/lethal-ignition.png\",\"bucket\":\"core\"}]},\"spell\":{\"slug\":\"flicker\",\"name\":\"Flicker\"},\"blessing\":null,\"flexItems\":[{\"item\":{\"slug\":\"magic-boots\",\"name\":\"Magic Boots\"},\"replace\":{\"slug\":\"arcane-boots\",\"name\":\"Arcane Boots\"},\"trigger\":\"Use when your team already has enough early damage and Vexana needs more frequent Deathly Grasp and Cursed Blast cycles.\"},{\"item\":{\"slug\":\"winter-crown\",\"name\":\"Winter Crown\"},\"replace\":{\"slug\":\"holy-crystal\",\"name\":\"Holy Crystal\"},\"trigger\":\"Use when one assassin or hard-engage combo can reach you before Blood Wings shield buys enough space.\"},{\"item\":{\"slug\":\"genius-wand\",\"name\":\"Genius Wand\"},\"replace\":{\"slug\":\"holy-crystal\",\"name\":\"Holy Crystal\"},\"trigger\":\"Use when your team has multiple magic damage dealers and stacked Magic Defense shred matters more than maximum late Magic Power.\"},{\"item\":{\"slug\":\"immortality\",\"name\":\"Immortality\"},\"replace\":{\"slug\":\"holy-crystal\",\"name\":\"Holy Crystal\"},\"trigger\":\"Use in late Lord defense when a single death ends the game and your damage is already enough to punish grouped entries.\"}],\"notes\":\"Default ranked mid build that turns Vexana's delayed zones and Eternal Guard pressure into burn, current-HP damage, shielded repositioning, and late penetration.\",\"totalCost\":12060,\"statLines\":[{\"key\":\"magicpower\",\"labelKey\":\"common.stats.magicPower\",\"unit\":\"flat\",\"group\":\"offensive\",\"value\":450,\"sources\":[\"Glowing Wand\",\"Wishing Lantern\",\"Blood Wings\",\"Divine Glaive\",\"Holy Crystal\"]},{\"key\":\"magicpen\",\"labelKey\":\"common.stats.magicPenetration\",\"unit\":\"percent\",\"group\":\"offensive\",\"value\":40,\"sources\":[\"Divine Glaive\"]},{\"key\":\"magicpenFlat\",\"labelKey\":\"common.stats.magicPenetration\",\"unit\":\"flat\",\"group\":\"offensive\",\"value\":10,\"sources\":[\"Arcane Boots\"]},{\"key\":\"hp\",\"labelKey\":\"common.stats.hp\",\"unit\":\"flat\",\"group\":\"defensive\",\"value\":300,\"sources\":[\"Glowing Wand\"]},{\"key\":\"mp\",\"labelKey\":\"commo